    "detailed_description": "Make one with the music and Run Through The Beat!<br><br>This fast paced parkour game is scattered with obstacles, some of them move with the tempo of the music. Run, slide, glide on the walls and reach the beam of the end.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The obstacles</h2><strong>- Blue walls stop you.</strong><br><strong>- White is the ground.<br>- Yellow and Orange walls can be run on.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607960/extras/c421f554bc023d3b499b6dbace80fd12.poster.avif?t=1704746894\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607960/extras/c421f554bc023d3b499b6dbace80fd12.webm?t=1704746894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607960/extras/c421f554bc023d3b499b6dbace80fd12.mp4?t=1704746894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607960/extras/a06bd7f818408bba2522f67e3e3df5b8.poster.avif?t=1704746894\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607960/extras/a06bd7f818408bba2522f67e3e3df5b8.webm?t=1704746894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607960/extras/a06bd7f818408bba2522f67e3e3df5b8.mp4?t=1704746894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>- Purple makes you faster when you slide on them.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607960/extras/1c41dad03212940e9f5fe87ca7244214.poster.avif?t=1704746894\" width=600 height=300 ><source sr